{"id":"8812becc0adfe44f","group":"93","path":"93/93-thm-powers-embedding.md","title":"thm-powers-embedding","display":"thm-powers-embedding","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","depends_on":["[[93-df-powers]]","[[93-df-ultraproduct]]","[[93-df-quotient-algebra]]","[[93-df-embedding]]","[[57-df-ultrafilter]]"],"display":"thm-powers-embedding","label":"93-thm-powers-embedding","aliases":["93-thm-powers-embedding"],"type":"theorem"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"10bfe2126b30365e\" href=\"?note=10bfe2126b30365e\" title=\"93-df-powers\">93-df-powers</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"77d2ef3450d9750f\" href=\"?note=77d2ef3450d9750f\" title=\"93-df-ultraproduct\">93-df-ultraproduct</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"510bd94349c4c6d9\" href=\"?note=510bd94349c4c6d9\" title=\"93-df-quotient-algebra\">93-df-quotient-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d611f4ac8b8895ab\" href=\"?note=d611f4ac8b8895ab\" title=\"93-df-embedding\">93-df-embedding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7f0d0eb6e6bd2aa7\" href=\"?note=7f0d0eb6e6bd2aa7\" title=\"57-df-ultrafilter\">57-df-ultrafilter</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-powers-embedding"},{"key":"label","html":"93-thm-powers-embedding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-thm-powers-embedding</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-powers-embedding-thm-powers-embedding\">thm-powers-embedding <code>thm-powers-embedding</code></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in V\">\\(I\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\neq\\varnothing\">\\(I\\neq\\varnothing\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\\)</span> is the set-ultrafilter predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"7f0d0eb6e6bd2aa7\" href=\"?note=7f0d0eb6e6bd2aa7\" title=\"57-df-ultrafilter\">57-df-ultrafilter</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ConstAlgFam}_{93}(\\mathbf A,I)\">\\(\\operatorname{ConstAlgFam}_{93}(\\mathbf A,I)\\)</span> is the constant algebra family of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"10bfe2126b30365e\" href=\"?note=10bfe2126b30365e\" title=\"93-df-powers\">93-df-powers</a>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Const}_{93}(a;\\mathbf A,I)\">\\(\\mathrm{Const}_{93}(a;\\mathbf A,I)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta^{\\tau}_{\\mathbf A,\\mathcal U,I}\">\\(\\delta^{\\tau}_{\\mathbf A,\\mathcal U,I}\\)</span> are defined below.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CongClass}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{CongClass}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta_{93}\">\\(\\Theta_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UltProd}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{UltProd}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}\\)</span> have their source signatures.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}powers\\text{-}embedding}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Const}_{93}(a;\\mathbf A,I)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle i,a\\rangle:i\\in I\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}powers\\text{-}embedding}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Const}_{93}(a;\\mathbf A,I)\\coloneqq\n\\{\\langle i,a\\rangle:i\\in I\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}powers\\text{-}embedding}\\vdash\n\\delta^{\\tau}_{\\mathbf A,\\mathcal U,I}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle a,\n\\operatorname{CongClass}_{93}\\left(\n\\mathrm{Const}_{93}(a;\\mathbf A,I);\n\\mathbf P_{93}(\\operatorname{ConstAlgFam}_{93}(\\mathbf A,I);I,\\tau),\n\\Theta_{93}(\\operatorname{ConstAlgFam}_{93}(\\mathbf A,I),\\mathcal U;I,\\tau)\n\\right)\\right\\rangle:a\\in|\\mathbf A|\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}powers\\text{-}embedding}\\vdash\n\\delta^{\\tau}_{\\mathbf A,\\mathcal U,I}\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle a,\n\\operatorname{CongClass}_{93}\\left(\n\\mathrm{Const}_{93}(a;\\mathbf A,I);\n\\mathbf P_{93}(\\operatorname{ConstAlgFam}_{93}(\\mathbf A,I);I,\\tau),\n\\Theta_{93}(\\operatorname{ConstAlgFam}_{93}(\\mathbf A,I),\\mathcal U;I,\\tau)\n\\right)\\right\\rangle:a\\in|\\mathbf A|\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}powers\\text{-}embedding}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land I\\in V\\land I\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}\\!\\left(\n\\delta^{\\tau}_{\\mathbf A,\\mathcal U,I},\\mathbf A,\n\\mathrm{UltProd}_{93}(\\operatorname{ConstAlgFam}_{93}(\\mathbf A,I),\\mathcal U;I,\\tau)\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}powers\\text{-}embedding}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land I\\in V\\land I\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land\\mathrm{Ultra}(\\mathcal U,I)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}\\!\\left(\n\\delta^{\\tau}_{\\mathbf A,\\mathcal U,I},\\mathbf A,\n\\mathrm{UltProd}_{93}(\\operatorname{ConstAlgFam}_{93}(\\mathbf A,I),\\mathcal U;I,\\tau)\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The canonical embedding into an ultrapower sends each element to the congruence class of its fully indexed constant tuple; the index-set ultrafilter is kept distinct from a Boolean-algebra ultrafilter.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-powers-embedding-thm-powers-embedding","text":"thm-powers-embedding `thm-powers-embedding`","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-powers","status":"resolved","id":"10bfe2126b30365e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-powers]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-ultraproduct","status":"resolved","id":"77d2ef3450d9750f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-ultraproduct]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-quotient-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"510bd94349c4c6d9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-quotient-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"d611f4ac8b8895ab","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"7f0d0eb6e6bd2aa7","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-ultrafilter]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"7f0d0eb6e6bd2aa7","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)$, $I\\in V$ with $I\\neq\\varnothing$, and $\\mathrm{Ultra}(